{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang HK\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK\", sans-serif;'>已解散的支聯會，煽動顛覆國家政權案，三名被告判囚五年兩個月至七年三個月。李卓人及何俊仁擔任公職長達21年，獲3個月刑期扣減，支聯會判罰150萬元，並需於3個月內繳清。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T03:40:52.102304+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}